1
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:34,000
You've improved a lot

2
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Given your skills, it'll be a pity
if you don't serve the Imperial Court

3
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,000
Really?

4
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Our country needs your help.
There might be a few tasks for you

5
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:49,000
The Palace wants new trees?
No problem!

6
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:52,000
I now plant eight to ten trees a day
or I'd feel out of place

7
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:56,800
And for every tree I grow, my right arm
would get stronger. It's true

8
00:01:57,800 --> 00:02:02,000
There are about 3,000 trees
just in the Capital alone

9
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:06,600
Plus the suburbs, there should be
over 40,000 trees altogether

10
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,000
Great!

11
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:13,000
So if you offer to serve the Court,
His Majesty may be so pleased...

12
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:17,000
he'll make you the imperial gardener!

13
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:21,000
The imperial gardener?
Tell me more!

14
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:26,600
I suspect Ouyang Xiaotian
is secretly staging a rebellion

15
00:02:26,600 --> 00:02:29,000
He tried to poison His Majesty

16
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:33,000
Now that Physician Luo is dead,
he might put all the blame on him

17
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:37,000
What has that to do with
the Imperial Gardener?

18
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:41,000
And why are you telling me all this?
You've got to be crazy

19
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:49,000
It has to do with the Imperial Court.
Everything does

20
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:53,000
If you find evidence against
Ouyang Xiaotian,

21
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:57,000
His Majesty could be so pleased
he might let you be...

22
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:59,000
the national tree-planting dealer

23
00:02:59,600 --> 00:03:03,600
Isn't that tantamount to
being the Imperial Gardener?

24
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:06,000
It's a deal worth clinching

25
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:10,000
You'll be the national dealer,
you know

26
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:15,800
Won't I be rich?
What am I supposed to do? Tell me...!

27
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:18,000
It's rather simple

28
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:23,600
Just shadow Ouyang Xiaotian and
report his movements to me

29
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:27,000
-Is that all?
-Right

30
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:30,800
-And I'll become the Imperial Gardener?
-Right

31
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:34,000
I'll get Shou to help.
Together, we'll do a better job

32
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:38,000
No... He has something else
on his mind

33
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:40,000
Don't you think he's been...?

34
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:47,600
You're right. He might ruin everything
and my Imperial Gardener will be gone

35
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:53,600
Do some planning.
I need to see to something

36
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:56,000
Sure.
Keep me informed of everything

37
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:03,000
The Imperial Gardener!

38
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:18,000
Physician Luo's wife came to me
a few days ago, seeking redress

39
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:22,000
-What did she say to you?
-What do you think she'd say to me?

40
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:26,600
You suspect I had something
to do with Physician Luo's death?

41
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:32,000
I told you - Physician Luo
killed himself out of guilt

42
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:36,600
I was used by them too.
Don't you believe me?

43
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:40,000
I do, that's why I'm frustrated

44
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:47,000
Surely you know that
a tall tree catches winds?

45
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:53,800
Many of the old officials are jealous
of me and are hostile towards me

46
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:58,000
They'll jump at every chance
to slander me

47
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:00,600
But there's no smoke without fire

48
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:01,600
Enough said

49
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:07,000
I won't disturb you further,
Your Highness

50
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:10,800
Wait, Xiaotian!
Are you angry?

51
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:15,000
I never do anything
against my conscience

52
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:21,000
So no matter what others say of me,
I don't take it to heart

53
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:26,600
But never did I dream that Your Highness
whom I trusted most would suspect me

54
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:29,000
I'm really disappointed

55
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:35,000
Please don't say that. It's not that
I believe them. I just...

56
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:40,000
The story they told was vivid,
so you wavered?

57
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:48,000
We grew up together.
Don't you know me inside out?

58
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:52,800
All these years, I've been serving His
Majesty loyally. Yet you doubt my loyalty

59
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:56,600
This is a big insult to me!

60
00:05:57,000 --> 00:06:00,000
Sorry, I shouldn't have suspected you

61
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:06,000
You live in the Palace and have
no idea how wicked some people can be

62
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:10,000
Even what you believe to be facts
may not be true,

63
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:13,000
let alone stories you hear
from a third party

64
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:16,000
I've said sorry.
Are you still angry?

65
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:20,600
You mean a lot to me.
I was worried you might do wrong

66
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,800
Please believe me

67
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:31,000
I'll never lie to you
or do anything that upsets you

68
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:46,000
You seem a changed person after
your trip to the Longevity Village

69
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:55,600
Were they good to you?
We had some bad experience there

70
00:06:56,000 --> 00:07:01,000
Actually, they're kind and
unsophisticated people

71
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:05,000
We wouldn't have bestowed fortune
and longevity on them otherwise

72
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:11,000
You really think you're
the Longevity Star?

73
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:13,000
Think of your difference in age

74
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:15,000
-Are you three?
-Or four?

75
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:18,000
You'd better wake up from your dream

76
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:20,000
Come back to your senses

77
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:24,000
If you don't believe me, go to the
Three Star Temple and see for yourself

78
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:27,600
The Longevity Star there
was the spitting image of myself

79
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:36,000
The more I see you, the more I think
you resemble the Stars too

80
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:40,000
You look just like Fortune Star,
and you, Prosperity Star

81
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:43,000
Especially you, Lu

82
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:47,000
Stop pointing at me. I'm Wei Delu,
not some Prosperity (lu) Star

83
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:49,000
There's a Lu in my name, that's all

84
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:53,000
That's it.
You are the Prosperity Star

85
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:57,000
The fact that I have a Lu in my name
doesn't mean I'm Prosperity Star

86
00:07:57,000 --> 00:08:01,000
Get the Jade Emperor to come down to
verify your words and I'll believe you

87
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:06,000
Why do you long to become an immortal?
What's so good about being one?

88
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:09,000
There are many advantages.
Immortality is one

89
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:13,000
Life should be regardless of length

90
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:17,000
What matters is to
lead a meaningful life

91
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:21,000
Otherwise, perpetual rejuvenation
is meaningless

92
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:27,000
Immortals are carefree.
They have no worries

93
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:32,000
Who says immortals have no worries?
Look at the Mountain God

94
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:37,000
He has to trouble over opening up
the mountain paths and planting trees

95
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:39,000
He isn't as carefree as us

96
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:47,600
Immortals can help people
with their powers

97
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:53,000
That's not necessarily the case

98
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:58,600
You're the Divine Physician.
You've saved many lives too

99
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:04,600
I have my point,
and you have yours

100
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:10,000
You don't agree with me,
and I don't agree with him

101
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:13,600
No...
My view is the same as Lu's

102
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:17,600
There are many disadvantages
for being an immortal

103
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:22,600
Firstly, you can't do as you please.
There's no freedom at all

104
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:27,000
Secondly, you can't have emotions
or get married and have children

105
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:29,800
So what's the point?

106
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:36,000
That's true. My mother can't wait
for me to get married and have children

107
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:42,000
If I become an immortal, I won't be able
to do that. And I'll have to leave Ruyi

108
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:44,600
I really can't bear to do that

109
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:48,000
Precisely. So stop dreaming of
becoming an immortal

110
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:51,600
Be content with being an ordinary man,
just like us

111
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:54,000
Fu can't be more right

112
00:09:54,000 --> 00:10:00,000
Marry Miss Ma, have a chubby son
and live in bliss

113
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:02,000
You'll be happier than an immortal!

114
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:05,000
I'll ask you one last time

115
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:09,800
If an immortal could get married and
have children, would you want to be one?

116
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:12,600
I'd consider it then

117
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:15,800
What if none of that is allowed?

118
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:18,000
You're crazy!

119
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:24,000
Come back!
Maybe there's room for negotiation!

120
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:27,000
Just take this packet of herbs
and get more sleep

121
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,000
Thank you

122
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:31,600
-What ails you, Uncle Chen?
-My stomach is aching

123
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:44,000
Look at the crowd! If we charge
a tael per head, how much will we make?

124
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:49,000
Different charges for different herbs.
Oh, we'll be rich...!

125
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:51,000
I'll buy buns every day...

126
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:58,600
It's your turn, Uncle Zhang!

127
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:04,000
Shou, I've bought you some buns.
Do take care of yourself

128
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:05,400
I will

129
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:11,000
You go ahead.
We'll go outside to maintain order

130
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,600
Thanks

131
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:15,600
No pushing!

132
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:18,000
You've collected your medicine?

133
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:22,000
It's free of charge.
Don't you know?

134
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:28,000
You must've made a mistake.
Nothing is free in this world

135
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:32,000
It's written outside: "A good deed
a day. Free medical services provided"

136
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:33,000
Wait!

137
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:36,200
Free of charge?!

138
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:38,800
Throw them out!

139
00:11:38,800 --> 00:11:42,200
No more medical services for today!
Leave!

140
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:44,800
You're not paying?
Out you go!

141
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:48,200
Why are you chasing everyone away?

142
00:11:51,200 --> 00:11:53,800
Why did you chase
all the patients away?

143
00:11:54,200 --> 00:12:00,200
I should be asking you! Why did you
provide free medical services?

144
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:07,000
Call yourself a physician! You don't
even realize you've got a screw loose!

145
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:12,700
My mind is perfectly sound, Sister

146
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:19,000
I provide free medical services
because I want to do more good deeds

147
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:22,000
It'll help me attain immortality

148
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:25,800
He does have a screw loose

149
00:12:25,800 --> 00:12:27,800
Let me have a look at you

150
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:35,000
You're out of your mind! What makes
you think you can become an immortal?

151
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:40,600
I used to be one!

152
00:12:56,000 --> 00:13:00,600
I used to be one!

153
00:13:03,800 --> 00:13:05,800
He doesn't know what he's saying!

154
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:09,600
Fine, go be an immortal!

155
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:14,600
Zhao Cai, take out the account book.
I'm dividing up our family property!

156
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:16,600
That's right.
We'll live apart!

157
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:19,000
What are you arguing about?

158
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:22,000
You came at the right time, Mother

159
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:26,000
Come and be the judge

160
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:30,000
Your son is providing free
medical services to the public

161
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:35,000
How are we to run the business?
He'll squander away all our money!

162
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:40,000
He's sick!
He's out of his mind!

163
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:46,000
Is it true, Shou?

164
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:50,600
Yes, I'm giving free medical services

165
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:55,000
But my purpose in doing that is to
accumulate good deeds for all of us

166
00:13:57,000 --> 00:14:00,000
We should live in harmony. Why do you
want to divide up our family fortune?

167
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:03,800
We must do that!
I insist!

168
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:08,000
You dare defy me.
Have you no more respect for me?

169
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:10,800
He's sick, Mother!

170
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:15,000
Simmer down, Mother.
Have some tea

171
00:14:17,500 --> 00:14:22,500
You're spoiling him, Mother.
He'll squander all our money away!

172
00:14:22,500 --> 00:14:27,500
We'll all be reduced to beggars.
It'll be such a disgrace!

173
00:14:27,500 --> 00:14:29,500
Shut up!

174
00:14:29,500 --> 00:14:31,500
Simmer down, Mother...

175
00:14:31,500 --> 00:14:33,500
Stop making Mother angry, Sis

176
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:38,000
Since you want to divide up
our family fortune, go ahead!

177
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:41,000
I'll hold you to that

178
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:44,000
He said it himself, Mother

179
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:49,000
There are six sets of rooms.
We'll divide them up as per head

180
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:51,000
Mother will live with me...

181
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:55,600
Don't say any more. You can
take it all. I don't want anything

182
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:59,000
No. I'll leave the smallest room
for you

183
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:01,000
You'll live with me, Mother

184
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:04,000
Let go!

185
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:09,000
I can't help worrying about Shou

186
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:13,800
Don't bother to talk me round.
I'm staying with him to look after him

187
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:15,800
It's set!

188
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:23,000
Why must you insist on
dividing up the family property?

189
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:30,600
Have a look and give me your views

190
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:34,800
You're revamping the Three Star
Temple? Is there a need?

191
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:38,000
You're going to do it here?

192
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:40,600
Where else can I do it?

193
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:44,000
You're wasting your effort

194
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:47,000
What do you mean?

195
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:52,000
A landlord from a neighbouring village
has bought this piece of land

196
00:15:52,800 --> 00:15:56,400
-Really?
-Why should I lie to you?

197
00:15:57,400 --> 00:15:59,400
You should've told me earlier

198
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:01,800
Save your effort, Shou

199
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:06,800
Why did someone from the neighbouring
village buy land here?

200
00:16:08,500 --> 00:16:13,500
My wish was to revamp the Three Star
Temple before I turned 30...

201
00:16:13,500 --> 00:16:16,500
so it'd benefit the people

202
00:16:17,500 --> 00:16:21,100
But a landlord has ruined everything

203
00:16:22,100 --> 00:16:26,100
I can't realize my dream now.
What a shame!

204
00:16:27,500 --> 00:16:29,500
Her Highness is suspicious of us

205
00:16:29,500 --> 00:16:31,500
How come?

206
00:16:32,500 --> 00:16:36,500
Wei Delu is to blame. He must
have been carrying tales about me

207
00:16:36,500 --> 00:16:42,500
Just because Her Highness backed him up,
he ganged up Wu Fuqi...

208
00:16:42,500 --> 00:16:45,500
to force Shi Yaoqian to go to jail

209
00:16:45,500 --> 00:16:47,500
He's out to set himself against you!

210
00:16:51,500 --> 00:16:53,300
Wei Delu...

211
00:16:53,500 --> 00:16:57,100
We already have weapons enough for
a 100,000-strong army

212
00:16:57,100 --> 00:16:59,500
Why don't we act now?

213
00:17:03,500 --> 00:17:08,300
I told you - clashing with His Majesty
is the last resort

214
00:17:08,300 --> 00:17:10,300
I don't want to upset Her Highness

215
00:17:10,500 --> 00:17:12,500
But she's getting suspicious

216
00:17:12,500 --> 00:17:16,500
I know what to do.
You need not worry about it

217
00:17:32,500 --> 00:17:38,100
Just who am I? Am I an ordinary man
or Longevity Star?

218
00:17:40,100 --> 00:17:42,100
Can anybody tell me?

219
00:17:43,500 --> 00:17:46,500
Can anyone tell me whether I'm
a mortal or Longevity Star?

220
00:18:01,500 --> 00:18:08,300
Little tortoise, can you tell me whether
I'm a mortal or Longevity Star?

221
00:18:21,500 --> 00:18:24,500
What a fool I am

222
00:18:24,500 --> 00:18:28,500
Even if you knew the answer, you couldn't
tell me. You can't possibly talk

223
00:18:38,300 --> 00:18:40,300
Who can give me an answer?

224
00:18:41,500 --> 00:18:45,500
If I'm an ordinary man,
let me do my part as an ordinary man

225
00:18:45,500 --> 00:18:49,500
If I'm an immortal,
let me do my part as an immortal

226
00:18:49,500 --> 00:18:55,500
I'm neither here nor there now.
It's frustrating

227
00:18:58,500 --> 00:19:00,500
Don't do this to me

228
00:19:53,500 --> 00:19:55,500
And such a big one at that!

229
00:19:57,500 --> 00:20:02,300
I'm already in a bad mood,
yet you still want to bully me!

230
00:20:02,500 --> 00:20:04,500
Wait till I get my hands on you!

231
00:20:12,500 --> 00:20:18,100
If I really am Longevity Star,
grant me my wish. It's rather simple

232
00:20:18,500 --> 00:20:22,500
Let the bird which excreted on
my forehead rest on my hand...

233
00:20:22,500 --> 00:20:24,500
and I'll believe it

234
00:20:29,500 --> 00:20:33,500
You really came down.
I don't believe this...

235
00:20:34,500 --> 00:20:38,500
You poohed on my forehead just now.
Not afraid I might beat you?

236
00:20:43,500 --> 00:20:47,100
I won't hold it against you.
You may go

237
00:20:53,500 --> 00:20:55,500
It's just a coincidence

238
00:20:57,100 --> 00:20:59,100
Stop scaring myself

239
00:21:01,500 --> 00:21:05,500
If you want me to believe you,
grant me another wish

240
00:21:05,500 --> 00:21:10,100
If it comes true, I'll be fully
convinced I'm Longevity Star

241
00:21:11,500 --> 00:21:13,500
This wish is also rather simple

242
00:21:13,500 --> 00:21:20,100
If someone will take out money to
renovate the Three Star Temple,

243
00:21:20,100 --> 00:21:21,500
I'll...

244
00:21:21,500 --> 00:21:26,500
Wake up, Young Master!
You can't just leave like that!

245
00:21:26,500 --> 00:21:30,500
I won't be able to account to Master!
Young Master...!

246
00:21:30,500 --> 00:21:32,500
What's wrong with him?

247
00:21:32,500 --> 00:21:35,500
We were walking and
he just conked out

248
00:21:35,500 --> 00:21:37,500
-Let me have a look
-Don't touch him!

249
00:21:37,500 --> 00:21:39,500
Relax, I'm a doctor

250
00:21:39,500 --> 00:21:42,500
You're a doctor?
Please save him!

251
00:21:43,500 --> 00:21:45,500
Please wake up, Young Master...

252
00:21:46,500 --> 00:21:47,500
Hold him

253
00:21:54,500 --> 00:21:56,500
Young Master, you've come to!

254
00:21:56,500 --> 00:21:58,500
All right, I've got it out

255
00:21:58,500 --> 00:22:02,500
-What was wrong with him?
-He got choked on a walnut

256
00:22:02,500 --> 00:22:05,500
-Keep a good eye on him in future
-I will...

257
00:22:06,500 --> 00:22:08,500
Thank you for saving his life...!

258
00:22:08,500 --> 00:22:10,500
Please get up

259
00:22:12,500 --> 00:22:17,500
Be careful with what you eat in future.
You might choke to death otherwise

260
00:22:17,500 --> 00:22:19,500
I won't do it again, Sir

261
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:20,500
Thank you!

262
00:22:20,500 --> 00:22:22,500
You'd better be on your way

263
00:22:24,500 --> 00:22:27,500
Wait! May I know your name
and where you live?

264
00:22:27,500 --> 00:22:29,500
I'm Mei Shouquan from Ping'an Town

265
00:22:29,500 --> 00:22:32,100
I'll ask my master to reward you

266
00:22:32,100 --> 00:22:36,100
No need for that. It's my duty
to save lives. Get going

267
00:22:36,100 --> 00:22:37,500
Thank you!

268
00:22:37,500 --> 00:22:39,500
Let's go, Young Master

269
00:23:02,500 --> 00:23:08,500
It's snowing so heavily. Why are you
standing here, Mother? Let's go in

270
00:23:08,500 --> 00:23:13,100
Leave me be. Neither of you
respect me as a mother

271
00:23:13,100 --> 00:23:15,100
Let me be frozen to death!

272
00:23:16,500 --> 00:23:19,500
You've caught a cold.
Go into the house with me

273
00:23:19,500 --> 00:23:26,100
You shouldn't have said all that.
I want you to enjoy longevity

274
00:23:26,500 --> 00:23:30,500
I don't want longevity. Neither do I
want you to become an immortal

275
00:23:30,500 --> 00:23:34,500
Just settle down and start a family
and I'll be content

276
00:23:35,300 --> 00:23:37,300
There you go again, Mother

277
00:23:37,500 --> 00:23:42,500
All right. Even if you asked me to marry
100 women, I'd do it. Go inside

278
00:23:43,500 --> 00:23:49,100
I don't like other women. I only want
Miss Ma to be my daughter-in-law

279
00:23:49,500 --> 00:23:55,500
Even if she wouldn't marry me,
I'd tie her up and bring her home

280
00:23:55,500 --> 00:23:57,500
Will that do?
Go on in

281
00:23:57,500 --> 00:24:02,500
I don't want empty talk.
Go and propose to Miss Ma right away

282
00:24:02,500 --> 00:24:08,500
All right, I'll go this minute. But you
must go inside the house at once too

283
00:24:08,500 --> 00:24:10,500
Make sure you keep your promise

284
00:24:15,500 --> 00:24:19,100
It's like this, Ruyi

285
00:24:20,500 --> 00:24:24,500
Shall I visit your family
one of these days?

286
00:24:24,500 --> 00:24:26,500
As you know, my family like you

287
00:24:26,500 --> 00:24:30,500
I'd like to meet your family
to see if they like me too

288
00:24:30,500 --> 00:24:35,500
You're not yourself today.
Can you just speak your mind?

289
00:24:35,500 --> 00:24:37,100
Marry me

290
00:24:39,500 --> 00:24:41,100
Marry me

291
00:24:41,500 --> 00:24:43,500
Why are you so straightforward?

292
00:24:44,500 --> 00:24:49,100
You asked me to speak my mind yet you're
not happy. What do you want me to do?

293
00:24:50,300 --> 00:24:52,300
Are you all right?

294
00:24:53,500 --> 00:24:59,100
My mother is getting on in years.
She's eager to have grandchildren

295
00:25:00,500 --> 00:25:03,300
Is that a yes?

296
00:25:04,500 --> 00:25:09,500
This is great! I'll go and make
arrangements to marry you at once!

297
00:25:12,100 --> 00:25:14,100
I need to think it over

298
00:25:17,500 --> 00:25:24,500
Marriage isn't a game.
You should think it over

299
00:25:26,500 --> 00:25:32,500
All right, think about it
before you give me a reply

300
00:25:33,500 --> 00:25:37,500
Take your time, but not too long.
Let's go home

301
00:25:38,500 --> 00:25:43,500
This way...
No, it's that way... or that way?

302
00:25:52,500 --> 00:25:54,500
Work faster!

303
00:26:00,500 --> 00:26:02,500
No skiving!

304
00:26:06,500 --> 00:26:09,500
Wow, so many weapons!

305
00:26:11,500 --> 00:26:13,500
It's worth tens of thousands!

306
00:26:13,500 --> 00:26:16,500
The explosives alone
are worth thousands!

307
00:26:21,500 --> 00:26:25,500
The Marquis wants 200,000 weapons
to be made in a month!

308
00:26:25,500 --> 00:26:28,500
If you can't meet the target,
you can't go home!

309
00:26:28,500 --> 00:26:34,500
Sir, why does the Marquis want
200,000 weapons in a month?

310
00:26:34,500 --> 00:26:38,500
He's going to accelerate his plan
to mount the throne, you fool!

311
00:26:38,500 --> 00:26:39,500
Get down to work!

312
00:26:41,500 --> 00:26:43,500
He's showing his true colours at last

313
00:26:43,500 --> 00:26:45,500
We must inform Fuqi-ge!

314
00:26:47,500 --> 00:26:51,500
It's quite obvious Ouyang Xiaotian is
rising in rebellion

315
00:26:52,500 --> 00:26:54,500
According to Fu's investigation,

316
00:26:54,500 --> 00:27:00,500
the blacksmiths have confirmed
Ouyang Xiaotian's plan to rebel

317
00:27:00,500 --> 00:27:04,100
They're busy making more weapons now

318
00:27:05,500 --> 00:27:07,500
This is the big discovery you meant?

319
00:27:07,500 --> 00:27:11,500
Your Highness, don't tell me
you still believe Ouyang Xiaotian?

320
00:27:12,500 --> 00:27:16,500
He's explained to Father the matter
regarding the arsenal

321
00:27:17,000 --> 00:27:21,000
He's only making weapons to guard
ourselves against foreign attacks

322
00:27:21,000 --> 00:27:24,600
But the blacksmiths couldn't have
made up the story

323
00:27:24,600 --> 00:27:29,200
I don't know why they said what they did.
There must be some misunderstanding

324
00:27:29,600 --> 00:27:34,400
You can't jump to conclusions based on
the blacksmiths' words alone

325
00:27:34,600 --> 00:27:39,400
Don't you think you're
siding with Ouyang Xiaotian?

326
00:27:39,600 --> 00:27:41,600
I think you're prejudiced against him

327
00:27:41,600 --> 00:27:47,200
What I said is true. Yet you...
I have nothing more to say

328
00:27:47,600 --> 00:27:49,600
I know you care about me

329
00:27:49,600 --> 00:27:53,600
But I've known Xiaotian for so long.
I don't believe he'd lie to me

330
00:28:09,600 --> 00:28:15,200
Her Highness should have more sense
than to believe Ouyang Xiaotian

331
00:28:16,600 --> 00:28:21,600
Don't say that of her.
She loves him wholeheartedly

332
00:28:21,600 --> 00:28:23,600
I can understand how she feels

333
00:28:24,600 --> 00:28:30,600
You're still siding with her.
It's you who love her wholeheartedly

334
00:28:34,600 --> 00:28:39,200
She'll never understand
my feelings for her

335
00:28:39,600 --> 00:28:43,200
I only hope that she won't be hurt

336
00:28:44,600 --> 00:28:47,600
You're the one who'll be hurt

337
00:28:49,600 --> 00:28:51,600
Don't say any more

338
00:28:51,600 --> 00:28:56,600
Our priority now is to find evidence
against Ouyang Xiaotian

339
00:28:57,600 --> 00:29:02,600
What else can we do? Her Highness
refuses to believe the blacksmiths

340
00:29:04,600 --> 00:29:09,600
There's someone whose words
Her Highness will believe for sure

341
00:29:13,600 --> 00:29:14,600
Who?

342
00:29:14,600 --> 00:29:16,600
Shall we get up first?

343
00:29:28,600 --> 00:29:31,600
I know Shi Yaoqian too well

344
00:29:50,200 --> 00:29:52,200
Why are you sharpening a sword?

345
00:29:56,600 --> 00:30:00,600
Magistrate Shi, did you eat your fill
at the last meal?

346
00:30:00,600 --> 00:30:02,600
Yes, I did

347
00:30:02,600 --> 00:30:08,600
By order of His Majesty, I'm here to
put you to death for staging a rebellion

348
00:30:09,600 --> 00:30:13,200
That's impossible!
I haven't done anything!

349
00:30:13,600 --> 00:30:17,600
Sorry, I'm just carrying out an order

350
00:30:19,600 --> 00:30:23,600
Mercy...! I'm innocent!
He made me do it...!

351
00:30:23,600 --> 00:30:28,600
He's after the throne. He's the one
who wants to rebel! Mercy...!

352
00:30:30,600 --> 00:30:37,200
Please have mercy on me, Lord Wei...

353
00:30:39,600 --> 00:30:40,600
Get up

354
00:30:43,200 --> 00:30:45,200
Why did you lie to me?

355
00:30:46,600 --> 00:30:48,600
Why did you lie to me...?

356
00:30:49,600 --> 00:30:53,600
Why aren't you content with
being the Prince Consort?

357
00:31:00,400 --> 00:31:02,400
Leave.
I don't want to see you

358
00:31:07,600 --> 00:31:10,200
I'm telling you to leave!

359
00:31:20,600 --> 00:31:21,600
Leave!

360
00:31:27,600 --> 00:31:29,600
Leave...!

361
00:31:30,200 --> 00:31:32,200
Are you all right, Your Highness?

362
00:31:33,600 --> 00:31:36,600
Get a hold on yourself

363
00:31:39,600 --> 00:31:45,600
I don't believe
Ouyang Xiaotian will lie to me

364
00:31:45,600 --> 00:31:48,600
I don't believe it...

365
00:32:01,600 --> 00:32:03,600
Father and I are so good to him

366
00:32:05,600 --> 00:32:10,400
Why is it that he's still
after the throne?

367
00:32:11,600 --> 00:32:13,200
Why...?

368
00:32:15,600 --> 00:32:18,600
I know this is a cruel fact to you

369
00:32:19,600 --> 00:32:24,600
But you must get a hold on yourself,
Your Highness

370
00:32:27,600 --> 00:32:33,600
He's the person I love most...!

371
00:32:40,600 --> 00:32:44,600
I don't believe it.
Not unless he tells me in person

372
00:32:46,600 --> 00:32:51,200
I'm not going to give up otherwise

373
00:33:05,600 --> 00:33:07,600
You must be calm

374
00:33:07,600 --> 00:33:10,600
Only then can you...

375
00:33:12,600 --> 00:33:15,600
see the truth

376
00:33:53,600 --> 00:33:54,600
Morning

377
00:33:54,600 --> 00:33:56,600
Nice weather

378
00:33:56,600 --> 00:33:58,600
Indeed.
Have you had dinner?

379
00:33:59,600 --> 00:34:03,200
I didn't hear the roaster crow
this morning

380
00:34:03,600 --> 00:34:05,600
-I'm not talking sense
-You're going home?

381
00:34:14,600 --> 00:34:17,600
What a pighead I am!
I'm such a failure!

382
00:34:18,600 --> 00:34:21,200
I look so affected!

383
00:34:22,600 --> 00:34:26,600
If you don't fancy me, just say it.
I'll concentrate on becoming an immortal

384
00:34:26,600 --> 00:34:30,600
I'm an immortal.
How can I possibly marry him?

385
00:34:31,600 --> 00:34:35,600
But I'm still not sure if I'm
Longevity Star. Why can't I get married?

386
00:34:35,600 --> 00:34:37,600
The seven fairies did that

387
00:34:38,600 --> 00:34:40,600
Envy the loving couple
but not the immortals

388
00:34:40,600 --> 00:34:44,600
If the seven fairies can get married,
why can't I?

389
00:34:44,600 --> 00:34:46,600
There's nothing to be afraid of

390
00:34:51,600 --> 00:34:53,600
Are you looking for me?

391
00:34:54,600 --> 00:34:58,600
About what you asked me the other day.
I've thought it over. My answer is yes

392
00:34:59,600 --> 00:35:03,600
You took so long to decide.
But never mind

393
00:35:03,600 --> 00:35:06,200
I'll visit your parents

394
00:35:06,600 --> 00:35:08,600
No need.
I'll ask them to come

395
00:35:08,600 --> 00:35:12,600
It's just as well.
I'm free only the day after tomorrow

396
00:35:12,600 --> 00:35:15,200
I'm also available
only the day after tomorrow

397
00:35:15,200 --> 00:35:17,200
I'll be waiting here for you then

398
00:35:17,200 --> 00:35:19,600
-See you the day after tomorrow
-Sure

399
00:35:38,600 --> 00:35:43,600
Wang Niu? Better change it
before they get married

400
00:35:45,600 --> 00:35:46,600
It's you, Ma-gu

401
00:35:46,600 --> 00:35:48,600
You made the wrong match again

402
00:35:48,600 --> 00:35:51,600
This is Zhao Jianjun and Kang Jinglei

403
00:35:51,600 --> 00:35:54,600
Two men?!
You're doomed!

404
00:35:54,600 --> 00:35:56,600
I'll pair them up with someone else...

405
00:35:58,600 --> 00:36:02,400
I smell wine.
You've brought along some wine?

406
00:36:05,600 --> 00:36:08,600
It is wine!
Let me have a look

407
00:36:08,600 --> 00:36:11,600
You have good taste.
I brewed it in person

408
00:36:11,600 --> 00:36:14,600
Even the Queen Mother
hasn't tasted it

409
00:36:14,600 --> 00:36:16,600
Really?
Let me have a few sips

410
00:36:16,600 --> 00:36:19,600
Drink to your heart's content
if you like it

411
00:36:20,600 --> 00:36:23,600
-What's this called?
-Ma-gu's nuptial wine

412
00:36:28,600 --> 00:36:31,400
-Whose nuptial wine did you say?
-Mine

413
00:36:31,600 --> 00:36:35,200
You're an immortal.
You're not supposed to get married

414
00:36:35,200 --> 00:36:39,200
Why can't I do that?
The seven fairies married mortals too

415
00:36:39,600 --> 00:36:41,600
Do you know the consequences?

416
00:36:42,600 --> 00:36:46,600
I'm not interested in finding out.
I just want to know if you'll help me

417
00:36:46,600 --> 00:36:48,600
What do you want me to do?

418
00:36:48,600 --> 00:36:52,600
Pose as my father to meet Mei Shouquan's
mother to discuss our marriage

419
00:36:52,600 --> 00:36:55,400
I'm not going to do it

420
00:36:56,600 --> 00:36:59,600
But you're the Deity of Marriage

421
00:37:00,600 --> 00:37:03,600
If you won't help me,
I'll go to Zhang Guolao!

422
00:37:03,600 --> 00:37:08,200
It's wrong of you
to want to get married

423
00:37:08,200 --> 00:37:11,600
If the Jade Emperor finds out,
I'll become an accomplice

424
00:37:11,600 --> 00:37:15,600
You've had my nuptial wine,
so there's no way you can be absolved

425
00:37:17,600 --> 00:37:19,600
You can have it back

426
00:37:19,600 --> 00:37:23,600
-You really won't help me?
-It's beyond me

427
00:37:24,600 --> 00:37:27,600
Very well,
I'll tell the Jade Emperor...

428
00:37:27,600 --> 00:37:33,600
you drank at work and even
put two men together

429
00:37:34,600 --> 00:37:40,600
The Jade Emperor must never know about
that. Please don't inform him!

430
00:37:40,600 --> 00:37:44,600
You're not my father, and I'm not
your daughter. Why should I help you?

431
00:37:44,600 --> 00:37:47,600
All right, just this once

432
00:37:47,600 --> 00:37:50,600
Thank you, Father!

433
00:37:51,600 --> 00:37:53,600
Please have some tea,
my prospective father-in-law

434
00:37:53,600 --> 00:37:55,600
Please have some tea

435
00:37:57,200 --> 00:37:59,200
Greet the guests, quick

436
00:37:59,200 --> 00:38:01,200
Grandpa, Sister, nice to meet you

437
00:38:01,600 --> 00:38:04,600
You're Zhao Jiujin, aren't you?
You're six

438
00:38:04,600 --> 00:38:07,600
Ten years from now,
you'll become a general's wife

439
00:38:08,600 --> 00:38:14,600
You actually know her name and that
she'll be marrying a general?

440
00:38:14,600 --> 00:38:18,200
You must be joking!
She, marrying a general?

441
00:38:18,200 --> 00:38:20,600
How would I not know?
I'm the Dei...

442
00:38:21,600 --> 00:38:24,600
My father likes to joke a lot.
Please don't take it to heart

443
00:38:25,600 --> 00:38:27,600
You have such a good sense of humour

444
00:38:27,600 --> 00:38:32,600
By rights, we should've visited you.
But you came instead

445
00:38:32,600 --> 00:38:34,600
We feel so bad

446
00:38:34,600 --> 00:38:37,400
Never mind.
You can't go up anyway

447
00:38:38,600 --> 00:38:42,600
I've told Shou my family lives in
a high mountain. It's rather inconvenient

448
00:38:43,600 --> 00:38:46,600
That's good.
The air is fresh in the mountains

449
00:38:46,600 --> 00:38:51,200
Shou told me you run a small business.
What is it?

450
00:38:51,600 --> 00:38:54,200
I just "pull strings"

451
00:38:55,600 --> 00:38:59,200
My father likes to joke.
We sell fabrics

452
00:38:59,600 --> 00:39:05,000
That's a big business!
How much do you make?

453
00:39:05,000 --> 00:39:06,600
We're doing fine

454
00:39:06,600 --> 00:39:10,600
I'm here just to tell you
I'm Miss Ma's father

455
00:39:12,600 --> 00:39:16,600
You're her father yet
you call her Miss Ma?

456
00:39:17,600 --> 00:39:22,600
It's my pet name. My parents have been
calling me that since I was little

457
00:39:25,600 --> 00:39:29,200
My job is done.
I have to go

458
00:39:30,600 --> 00:39:32,600
We haven't discussed their marriage

459
00:39:33,400 --> 00:39:35,400
Marriage?
I don't hear of it

460
00:39:35,600 --> 00:39:38,200
Are you not happy with my son?

461
00:39:38,600 --> 00:39:40,600
Give me a minute

462
00:39:43,600 --> 00:39:48,200
I'm to pose as your father. You never
asked me to agree to the marriage

463
00:39:48,600 --> 00:39:51,600
Immortals are not supposed to
get married

464
00:39:51,600 --> 00:39:53,600
Never you mind!
Just agree to it!

465
00:39:53,600 --> 00:39:56,600
You'll bear all the consequences

466
00:40:02,600 --> 00:40:08,200
Master Ma, Ruyi and I are serious about
each other. Please give us your blessings

467
00:40:10,200 --> 00:40:13,200
Do give them your blessings

468
00:40:15,600 --> 00:40:17,600
See what a perfect match they are

469
00:40:17,600 --> 00:40:22,600
The 10th day of next month is an
auspicious day. Let them tie the knot

470
00:40:24,600 --> 00:40:26,600
Go on your knees!

471
00:40:26,600 --> 00:40:29,600
-My respects to Father-in-law!
-Please get up

472
00:40:29,600 --> 00:40:33,200
Congratulations, Uncle, Aunt!

473
00:40:33,600 --> 00:40:35,600
Sorry I'm late

474
00:40:35,600 --> 00:40:38,600
Where did you go?
The marriage has been settled!

475
00:40:38,600 --> 00:40:43,600
Congratulations! I passed by
the Three Star Temple just now

476
00:40:43,600 --> 00:40:47,600
I heard a rich man from the Capital
is going to revamp the temple

477
00:40:47,600 --> 00:40:49,600
Isn't that strange?

478
00:40:49,600 --> 00:40:52,200
Someone is revamping the temple?

479
00:40:52,200 --> 00:40:55,600
Don't you think
he's out of his mind?

480
00:40:56,600 --> 00:41:01,200
The temple has been abandoned for years.
Who'd go there to pray after renovation?

481
00:41:01,200 --> 00:41:04,600
I must say he has
too much money to spare

482
00:41:05,600 --> 00:41:07,600
What's the matter, Shou?

483
00:41:08,400 --> 00:41:10,400
Nothing...

484
00:41:13,400 --> 00:41:14,400
Xiaotian!

485
00:41:14,400 --> 00:41:16,400
-What's the matter?
-We must go!

486
00:41:16,600 --> 00:41:18,600
Take your leave

487
00:41:18,600 --> 00:41:23,400
Wei Delu slandered you and Shi Yaoqian
accused you of staging a rebellion

488
00:41:23,400 --> 00:41:27,400
Father has learnt about it and
has sent men to arrest you! Run!

489
00:41:27,400 --> 00:41:28,600
How is that possible?

490
00:41:28,600 --> 00:41:30,200
Run for your life!

491
00:41:30,600 --> 00:41:33,600
-What about you?
-I'll stall for time

492
00:41:33,600 --> 00:41:36,600
Wei Delu won't harm me.
Go!

493
00:41:36,600 --> 00:41:39,600
No! I'll stay to protect you

494
00:41:39,600 --> 00:41:44,200
Once the army is here,
you'll be doomed

495
00:41:44,200 --> 00:41:50,200
Don't worry. Even if he sends all his
troops, he can't do anything to me

496
00:41:50,600 --> 00:41:53,600
Don't be crazy!
Stop putting on a strong front

497
00:41:53,600 --> 00:41:55,600
What I said is true

498
00:41:55,600 --> 00:42:00,200
Given the way things are, I might
as well send my troops to the Capital!

499
00:42:04,600 --> 00:42:06,600
He's owned up

500
00:42:09,600 --> 00:42:12,600
Now do you believe me,
Your Highness?

501
00:42:13,600 --> 00:42:14,600
Wei Delu!

502
00:42:14,600 --> 00:42:17,200
You actually ganged up
with him on me!

503
00:42:18,600 --> 00:42:23,600
Didn't you say you'd never
do anything to upset me or lie to me?

504
00:42:23,600 --> 00:42:26,200
How could you do a thing like this?

505
00:42:26,600 --> 00:42:30,600
No matter how ambitious I am,

506
00:42:30,600 --> 00:42:34,600
there's no turning back for me now

507
00:42:35,600 --> 00:42:39,200
But my feelings for you are true!

508
00:42:39,200 --> 00:42:41,200
I'm not going to believe you again

509
00:42:41,600 --> 00:42:46,200
In order to be the Emperor,
you disregarded Father's kindness,

510
00:42:46,600 --> 00:42:48,600
and poisoned him

511
00:42:48,600 --> 00:42:53,200
In order to be the Emperor,
you made use of my love for you

512
00:42:53,600 --> 00:42:58,600
Is the throne so important to you?
How could you do something so disloyal?

513
00:42:59,600 --> 00:43:03,600
Do you think your father is a good
emperor? He's fatuous and incompetent

514
00:43:03,600 --> 00:43:07,600
Am I considered a loyal official
only if I do his bidding?

515
00:43:07,600 --> 00:43:10,600
That's nonsense!

516
00:43:11,600 --> 00:43:16,200
You're too naive. Do you know how many
people are living in extreme misery?

517
00:43:16,600 --> 00:43:19,600
Many of them are always hungry

518
00:43:19,600 --> 00:43:23,600
And many families have to sell their
possessions and even their children!

519
00:43:24,600 --> 00:43:28,600
Even if that's the case, can you
change all that if you mount the throne?

520
00:43:28,600 --> 00:43:31,200
Certainly!
I'm confident!

521
00:43:31,600 --> 00:43:37,200
Just you wait! The people will
realize who I'm doing this for

522
00:43:37,200 --> 00:43:39,200
I'm doing it for their sake!

523
00:43:40,600 --> 00:43:46,600
Don't carry on your mistake. Come with
me. I'll ask Father to forgive you

524
00:43:46,600 --> 00:43:51,600
I know very well what I'm doing.
That's out of the question!

525
00:43:52,600 --> 00:43:55,600
Since your mind is made up,

526
00:43:56,600 --> 00:43:59,600
I have nothing more to do with you
from now on!

527
00:44:01,600 --> 00:44:04,600
I won't let you leave!
You'll see me mount the throne!

528
00:44:04,600 --> 00:44:05,600
What impertinence!

529
00:44:08,600 --> 00:44:09,600
Lu!

530
00:44:09,600 --> 00:44:11,200
Go, Your Highness!

531
00:44:24,600 --> 00:44:25,600
Your Highness!

532
00:44:32,400 --> 00:44:33,400
Your Highness!

533
00:44:40,600 --> 00:44:42,600
Seize the assassins!

534
00:44:49,600 --> 00:44:51,600
Seize them!

535
00:44:53,600 --> 00:44:56,600
You want to be the Emperor?
Dream on!

536
00:44:56,600 --> 00:44:58,600
Get them!

537
00:44:58,600 --> 00:45:00,600
Subtitled by S Lin


